SUMMARY:Twelfth Night
DESCRIPTION:History: Twelfth Night concludes the Christmastide counting fro
 m medieval Europe\, blending Christian Epiphany vigils with older winter re
 vels.\nTraditions: Hosts crown a king or queen with hidden bean charms\, wa
 ssailers sing at doorways\, and revelers dismantle greenery to avoid a year
  of bad fortune.\nFeasting: Tables feature spiced ale\, figgy puddings\, ki
 ng cakes filled with almonds\, and roasted meats shared before the fasting 
 of Epiphany begins.\nDay: Monday\n\nIcon: 🎭\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: cultu
 ral\\\\\\
CATEGORIES:cultural\\\\\\
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:https://dcmcshan.github.io/MaybeSomethingSeasonal/images/twelfth-night-end-of-the-christmas-season.png
END:VEVENT
