SUMMARY:Epiphany (Three Kings Day)
DESCRIPTION:History: Since the second century\, Epiphany has celebrated the
  Magi recognising the Christ child\, symbolising the revelation of the divi
 ne to the nations.\nTraditions: Families bless doorways with chalk\, stage 
 pageants of camels and kings\, and children receive gifts left by los Reyes
  Magos or La Befana.\nFeasting: Bakers craft rosca de reyes\, galette des r
 ois\, or king cakes\, while households sip rich hot chocolate and share slo
 w-simmered stews.\nDay: Tuesday\n\nIcon: 👑\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: cultur
 al\\\\\\
CATEGORIES:cultural\\\\\\
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:https://dcmcshan.github.io/MaybeSomethingSeasonal/images/epiphany-three-kings-day-celebration-of-the-magi.png
END:VEVENT
