SUMMARY:Imbolc Day Celebration
DESCRIPTION:History: With the lambing season underway\, Imbolc marks the mi
 dpoint between solstice and equinox\, long tied to the rebirth of light and
  Brigid's protective cloak.\nTraditions: Pilgrims visit holy wells\, sprink
 le thresholds with blessed water\, and hang swaddles outdoors to absorb Bri
 gid's healing power.\nFeasting: Communities share bannocks\, colcannon\, du
 lse\, and honeyed porridges\, often concluding with tea infused with the fi
 rst tender herbs.\nDay: Sunday\n\nIcon: 🌱\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: seasona
 l\\\\\\
