SUMMARY:Saint Valentine's Day
DESCRIPTION:History: The feast of the third-century martyr Valentine intert
 wined with courtly love through Chaucer's poetry and later Victorian card e
 xchanges.\nTraditions: Couples exchange handwritten notes\, roses\, and act
 s of service\, while many support charitable causes in the spirit of selfle
 ss love.\nFeasting: Sweethearts linger over chocolate-dipped strawberries\,
  heart-shaped confections\, fine champagne\, and candlelit suppers for two.
 \nDay: Saturday\n\nIcon: 💕\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: cultural\\\\\\
