SUMMARY:Saint Patrick's Day
DESCRIPTION:History: Patrick's fifth-century mission in Ireland inspired me
 dieval hagiographies\, and Irish diaspora communities transformed his feast
  into global parades of pride.\nTraditions: Bagpipers march past green land
 marks\, shamrock pins bedeck lapels\, and Gaelic blessings are shared betwe
 en friends and strangers alike.\nFeasting: Menus highlight corned beef and 
 cabbage\, soda bread\, colcannon\, smoked salmon\, and stout or whiskey rai
 sed in hearty toast.\nDay: Tuesday\n\nIcon: ☘️\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: cul
 tural\\\\\\
