SUMMARY:Earth Day
DESCRIPTION:History: US senator Gaylord Nelson and organiser Denis Hayes la
 unched Earth Day in 1970\, igniting the modern environmental movement with 
 teach-ins across the country.\nTraditions: Volunteers plant trees\, clean w
 aterways\, host sustainability workshops\, and advocate for climate justice
  at community fairs.\nFeasting: Earth-friendly gatherings feature seasonal 
 salads\, plant-based potlucks\, fair-trade coffee\, and desserts sweetened 
 with local honey.\nDay: Wednesday\n\nIcon: 🌍\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: envi
 ronmental\\\\\\
