SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox (Mabon)
DESCRIPTION:History: The equinox equalises day and night worldwide\, inspir
 ing harvest observances from Ancient Greece's Thesmophoria to modern pagan 
 Mabon rites.\nTraditions: People decorate altars with gourds and leaves\, p
 ractice gratitude journaling\, and take twilight walks to feel the seasonal
  balance.\nFeasting: Harvest tables brim with roasted squash\, apple tarts\
 , caramelised root vegetables\, mulled cider\, and hearty grain salads.\nDa
 y: Tuesday\n\nIcon: 🍂\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: seasonal\\\\\\
CATEGORIES:seasonal\\\\\\
