SUMMARY:Dia de los Angelitos
DESCRIPTION:History: On 1 November\, Mexican families honour children who h
 ave died\, believing their angelitos return first to enjoy the love of thei
 r kin.\nTraditions: Altars glow with candles\, toys\, and paper cut-outs\, 
 while families ring bells and scatter marigolds to guide the little spirits
  home.\nFeasting: Offerings feature atole\, sugar skulls\, tiny pan de muer
 to loaves\, fruit\, and favourite sweets that delighted the children in lif
 e.\nDay: Saturday\n\nIcon: 👼\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCategory: cultural\\\\\\
