  and later became canon as Kashyyyk's annual celebration of freedom and fam
 ily.\nTraditions: Wookiees gather beneath the Tree of Life\, sing in the Sh
 yriiwook tongue\, share glowing orbs\, and meditate on harmony across the g
 alaxy.\nFeasting: Fans imagine ryshcate sweet breads\, bantha stew\, roaste
 d yeca fruits\, and steaming mugs of blue bantha milk enjoyed around commun
