  ers crown Catherinettes in towering yellow and green hats\, churches bless r
  ibbons and lace\, and craft fairs raise funds for apprentices considering re
  ligious life.\nFeasting: Bakeries share saffron cattern cakes\, honeyed bisc
  uits\, mulled cider\, and spiced wine served after evening vespers.\nDay: Tu
  esday\n\nIcon: 🎓
